{"unit_id":"gmleong__dsh-img#card-zh","repo":"gmleong/dsh-img","commit":"7b4b62e75949b02fb9d01a8fbbdae434d0db42fb","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-img 为 DSH Web 增加视觉问答和图像处理能力。它注册 analyze_image 与 vision_ground，可让视觉模型回答图片问题并定位目标；本地工具支持裁剪、像素差异热图、取色、OCR、位图转 SVG 和均匀背景抠图。可选聊天桥接会先把图片附件转成文字再交给文本模型。视觉后端可配置智谱、Qwen、Ollama 或兼容端点；远程端点会收到图片与问题，本地处理工具无需视觉服务密钥，远程后端按所选服务配置凭据。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:27-46","index.js:252-351","index.js:648-814"]}
{"unit_id":"gmleong__dsh-img#card-en","repo":"gmleong/dsh-img","commit":"7b4b62e75949b02fb9d01a8fbbdae434d0db42fb","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-img adds image understanding to DSH through vision Q&A, object localization, and local tools for cropping, comparison, OCR, color extraction, SVG tracing, and background removal. An optional chat bridge converts image attachments to text for text-only models.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:27-46","index.js:252-351","index.js:648-814"]}
