{"unit_id":"gmleong__dsh-img#caveat-1","repo":"gmleong/dsh-img","commit":"7b4b62e75949b02fb9d01a8fbbdae434d0db42fb","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-img 使用远程视觉后端时会发送图片和问题至所配置的服务；选择 Ollama 时请求指向本机地址。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:27-46","index.js:209-234"]}
{"unit_id":"gmleong__dsh-img#caveat-2","repo":"gmleong/dsh-img","commit":"7b4b62e75949b02fb9d01a8fbbdae434d0db42fb","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-img 默认智谱后端需要 ZHIPU_API_KEY；聊天图片桥接也会调用视觉后端。启用缓存时，识别结果会写入用户目录下的缓存文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:27-30","index.js:202-207","index.js:250-251"]}
